# Everything here is either a credential or a list of real people. easyq-crm is a PUBLIC
# repository — treat an accidental commit of any of these as a leak, not a mistake.

# The session string IS the login. Anyone holding it is signed in as you, with no code and no
# password prompt. It is not recoverable-by-reset like a password; revoke it from
# Telegram → Settings → Devices.
session.txt
*.session

